---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Partner Alliance" description="We are open to all forms of strategic partnership. If your network relies on operational clarity to succeed, we are the engine room.">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="hero hero-full hero-center">
      <span class="eyebrow boxed">Open Ecosystem</span>
      <h1>Our Network <br /><span class="gold-text">is an Ecosystem.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">Great businesses are not built in isolation. Whether you are an agency, a consultant, a VC, or a fellow operator, if your network relies on operational clarity to succeed, we are the engine room. We ensure your clients' ledgers remain impeccably kept.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions" style="justify-content:center;">
        <a href="/contact/?topic=partnership" class="btn">Start a Partnership</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow boxed">Alliance Standard</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">The Partnership <span class="gold-text">Framework.</span></h2>
        <p class="lead">We are open to all forms of strategic partnership, from white-label operational support to reciprocal referral networks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="card top-gold lift">
          <div class="num">01</div>
          <h4>Reliability First</h4>
          <p>Your reputation is your currency. When you refer a partner, you are staking that reputation. We treat that trust as our primary asset. We execute effectively and we do not miss deadlines.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card top-gold lift">
          <div class="num">02</div>
          <h4>Mutual Velocity</h4>
          <p>Clean data makes everyone faster. If you provide marketing, legal, or strategy services to a client, our output gives you the verified intel you need to do your job better.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card top-gold lift">
          <div class="num">03</div>
          <h4>Lane Discipline</h4>
          <p>We deliver performance finance operations. We do not upsell marketing, we do not practice law, and we do not pretend to be tax filers. We stay in our lane so you can fully own yours.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
